  "body": "**Describe the bug**\nI am dealing with an issue where custom tags with a blank like leads to nonsense yaml being produced.\n\n```\n- type: entity\n  components:\n  - type: InstantAction\n    event: !type:CritSuccumbEvent\n\n-------------------------\n- type: entity\n  components:\n  - type: InstantAction\n    event:\n                                                   <--- these two \\n are the issue\n      !type:CritSuccumbEvent \n```\n\n**To Reproduce**\nI made a little test script to show the behavior, the expectation would be that input and output are the same.\nhttps://gist.github.com/Pachat-Kas/c3816a67a3f21703e882ef9f5862bb07 \n\n**Expected behaviour**\nThe test script should produce the same intput as the output. \n\n**Versions:**\n\n- Environment: [node v23.9.0]\n- `yaml`: [2.9.0]\n\n**Additional context**\nI found some similar looking issues but on closer inspection they weren't related.\n",
